":["건ː물"]},{"id":"2d2c5031ac715059","term":"외부","zh":"外部","audio":"/audio/2d2c5031ac7150591787.mp3","entryId":"22165","definition":"外面的部分。","pronunciation":["외ː부","웨ː부"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/1232f072fc9190d50ab4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22165-1-10-2","ko":"이 복도를 따라 가시면 됩니다.","zh":"沿着这条走廊走就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"복도를","meaning":"走廊，楼道","explanation":"복도：走廊，楼道；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"복도","audio":"/audio/9d00137ef85a652be054.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59542","senseId":"1","lemma":"복도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복도를","audio":"/audio/aa78a2f85ea869fc9ebc.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"沿着","explanation":"따르다：沿着；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"6","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"가시면","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","